{"format":"tvf-scene","v":1,"name":"example · Solving 3x + 5 = 20","loop":11.4,"ease":"inout","hold":0,"gravity":1,"wind":0,"trail":null,"camera":[],"stops":[0.1842,0.4123,0.6316,0.8509],"beats":[{"title":"An equation","text":"Three of something and [five more](#lit:2,3) make [twenty](#lit:5). What is the [something](#lit:1)?"},{"title":"The five crosses","text":"Take five from both sides. On the left it is gone; on the right it stands [taken away](#lit:6,3)."},{"title":"Twenty less five","text":"Twenty less five is [fifteen](#lit:7): three of the something make fifteen."},{"title":"The three goes under","text":"Divide both sides by [three](#lit:0). It leaves the x and stands [under the fifteen](#lit:8,0)."},{"title":"Five","text":"Fifteen in threes is [five](#lit:9). The [something](#lit:1) is five."}],"path":null,"items":[{"fill":{"color":"#f4f1ea","opacity":1},"stroke":null,"width":0,"open":false,"exact":{"x":[-0.9,0.9,0.9,-0.9],"y":[0.3825,0.3825,-0.3825,-0.3825],"r":null,"smooth":null,"ctrl":null,"holes":[]}},{"morph":0},{"morph":1},{"morph":2},{"morph":3},{"morph":4},{"morph":10},{"morph":5},{"morph":11},{"morph":6},{"morph":7},{"morph":12},{"morph":8},{"morph":9}],"morphs":[{"exact":true,"open":false,"holes":null,"keys":[{"x":[-0.3796875,-0.3705525,-0.36531,-0.35901,-0.3538125,-0.34848,-0.346275,-0.343755,-0.34272,-0.34209,-0.34173,-0.34173,-0.34209,-0.343845,-0.346005,-0.3481875,-0.3520575,-0.3574125,-0.3620925,-0.36252,-0.356355,-0.35073,-0.3465,-0.344115,-0.3429,-0.341505,-0.34038,-0.339255,-0.33921,-0.3404025,-0.341775,-0.343575,-0.3455325,-0.3481875,-0.351315,-0.353835,-0.35739,-0.36225,-0.368865,-0.3741975,-0.37953,-0.388125,-0.3926925,-0.3955275,-0.397665,-0.401625,-0.405405,-0.4071825,-0.4085775,-0.410265,-0.41058,-0.41013,-0.39114,-0.390555,-0.3899475,-0.38889,-0.387675,-0.385875,-0.3834225,-0.3810825,-0.37863,-0.375615,-0.372825,-0.37035,-0.3674475,-0.365535,-0.363825,-0.362115,-0.36036,-0.35946,-0.359505,-0.3606075,-0.3628125,-0.365625,-0.369225,-0